# Keep the build context small and prevent host artifacts (and secrets) from
# ever entering an image layer.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.data

# Secrets. `.env.example` is intentionally NOT ignored — it is documentation.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.gitignore
**/*.log
.DS_Store

# Docs and planning material are not build inputs.
*.md
docs
legacy
